  "_comment": "Mob templates. pawn_class: SGONPCPawn (creatures/NPCs) or SGOPCPawn (player-like). race: races_classes.RACES id. gear: m_AttachmentGroups entries [mesh type, mesh number, inventory slot] (docs/GEAR.md). damage: [min, max] per hit. loot: a table in loot.json. level -> m_GameplayLevel; title -> m_PlayerDisplayTitle (optional). Placeholder data until the content editor exists (docs/CONTENT_EDITOR.md). merchant: a merchants.json list id (makes the NPC a vendor that can't be attacked). Creatures: race = creature race id (docs/CREATURES.md, e.g. 119 wolf, 69 bear, 104 giant spider), model = variant number (m_iModelNum), gender 1 for female-only races; no gear. aggro_radius: attacks players that come this close (0 = only when attacked). harvest: makes a resource node (EntityTypes 0x800): {kind: mining/lumberjacking/..., item: items.json name, quantity: [min, max], tool: text for /con}. station: true makes a crafting station (EntityTypes 0x4). parley: true lets players parley with the NPC (diplomacy).",
